@startuml capability-autonomous-realization-boundary
title Capability vs Autonomous Capability Realization Boundary
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

class "Capability\n<<universal>>" as cap
class "Autonomous Capability\n<<specialization>>" as acap

cap <|-- acap : contextual specialization

note right of cap
  What an Entity can achieve
  (enduring ability)
  per ADR-ES-002
end note

note right of acap
  How the ability can be realized
  (bounded independence)
  per ADR-ES-013 §3.1
end note

note bottom of acap
  Autonomy qualifies realization
  Does NOT redefine Capability
end note
@enduml
